 been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  09 REMOVED_MONTH 00 at 13 46 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  right breast mass  is a 4 x 3 x 2cm piece of tan yellow fibrofatty breast tissue  The specimen is inked in black and sectioned to reveal a tan yellow ill defined firm area of REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm that abuts the superior posterior margin and is 1cm away from the lateral margin  1 3cm away from the anterior margin  1 3cm away from the inferior margin and blank away from the medial margin  The lateral margin is overinked in green  medial margin overinked in blue  Additional sections of tumor from the area identified on frozen section as infiltrating carcinoma are submitted in B C with the black inked margin representing the superior posterior margin  The remaining firm area at the medial aspect of the tumor is submitted in radial sections with the superior posterior margin in black and the medial most margin overinked in blue in cassettes D E  Fibrous areas lateral to the mass is submitted in radial sections relative to the lateral margin  with the superior posterior margin in black and the lateral margin in green in cassettes F H  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  additional deep margin right breast  is one large tan yellow fibrofatty piece of tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  and two smaller piece of tan yellow fatty tissue measuring in aggregate REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm in aggregate  All pieces are inked in black  The smaller pieces are submitted in toto in I  The larger piece is serially section to reveal tan white fibrous parenchyma  The larger pi