ntained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  THE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR PROGESTERONE RECEPTOR PROTEIN ARE FOR INVESTIGATIONAL USE ONLY  THEY MUST NOT BE USED FOR CLINICAL PURPOSES  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  25 REMOVED_MONTH 93 at 10 48 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab labeled  right breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm of fibroadipose tissue with a 0 9cm in diameter firm  tan gray irregular area extending to the inked margin  The firm area is submitted in A and B  The remainder is submitted in C and D  Resident  Jeoffry Brennick  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  RIGHT BREAST MASS   AREA SUSPICIOUS FOR INFILTRATING CARCINOMA BUT NOT LARGE ENOUGH TO FREEZE  AWAIT PERMANENTS  O R  Resident  William H  Yong  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Ben Zion Pilch  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST MASS   report_end  , Unchecked.
