e receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  13 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 16 54 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Left breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm left breast excision with a REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm overlying skin ellipse and a 2 0cm incision in the skin  There is a long suture to indicate the lateral margin and a short suture to indicate the superior margin  The specimen is inked as follows  Superior margin   blue  medial margin   red  inferior margin   yellow  lateral margin   green  deep margin   black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a small previous biopsy cavity but otherwise unremarkable breast parenchyma  The specimen is submitted entirely from superior to inferior in cassettes A through F  Resident  DAVID SABLE  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION   report_end  , Unchecked.
