boratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Grace T  McKee MD Signed On  09 MAY 01 at 14 45 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  right breast tissue  is a 18 x 15 x 4cm right modified radical mastectomy specimen with an attached 8 x 6 x 2cm axillary tail  On the anterior surface a 9 x 2 5cm tan skin ellipse with an intact nipple is identified  The specimen is inked black and serially sectioned to reveal a 5 x 4 x 2 5cm well circumscribed tan mass  1cm from from posterior and more than 2cm to all other margins  The mass has tan homogenous cut surface and surrounded by irregular firm tan areas  extending 5cm superiorly and 4cm medially  SECTION CODE A C  Tumor in relation to the posterior margin D  Representative sections of tumor E  Firm area 5cm superior to tumor in relation to the posterior margin F  Firm area 4cm medial to tumor in relation to the posterior margin G  Firm area 4cm medial to tumor in relation to the anterior margin Dissection of axillary tail reveals multiple lymph nodes ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm to 1 x 1 x 1cm  Smaller lymph nodes are entirely submitted in cassette H  REMOVED_DATE of the larger lymph node submitted in cassettes I J  Resident  SONER ALTIOK  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Kevin Hughes MD James Warren May Jr   M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
