gned On  15 REMOVED_MONTH 93 at 08 05 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  in two parts  Labeled  Right breast biopsy  is a REMOVED_DATE x 2 x 1cm piece of rubbery  white tissue with admixed fat  The specimen is inked  sectioned and submitted in A and B  The next specimen consists of a left radical mastectomy specimen measuring 20 x 22 x 5cm with an attached 15 x 8 x 3cm axillary tail  The overlying skin measures 15 x 9cm and contains a slightly off center 3 5cm areola with a 1 2cm nipple  A REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 8cm well circumscribed  tan and vaguely rubbery tumor with rare cysts measuring 2 to 3mm is present superior to the nipple with overlying thinned  however not ulcerated skin  The tumor is present underneath the areola but does not grossly involve the nipple  The tumor is present 1 5cm from the deep resection margin  which is the nearest resection margin  The tumor is present 6cm from the medial resection margin  8cm from the superior resection margin  10 5cm from the inferior resection margin  and 20cm from the lateral axillary resection margin  The remainder of the breast tissue is tan white and rubbery with multiple cyst present measuring from 1mm to 1cm  Several cysts contain turbid green mucoid tissue  A gross photograph is taken  The remainder of the breast tissue also shows focal areas of punctate cloudy yellow    necrotic  tissue  Section Code  C  medial resection margin  D  superior resection margin  E  inferior resection margin  F G  representative sections of tumor and deep resection margin  H  another section of deep resection margin  I  representative section of tumor with irregular 0 8cm tan red area  J  representative section of tumor  skin and adjacent nipple  K  representative section of tumor and skin  L O  representative sections of remainder of breast tissue  P T  axillary lymph nodes ranging in size from 4mm to 1 5cm  U  other section of breast with separate tan  sligh